{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>美國地質勘探局（USGS）表示，太平洋島國瓦努阿圖於香港時間今日（23日）早上10時40分發生6.5級地震。香港天文台表示，地震發生在本港時間上午10時40分，震央位於南緯13.69度，東經172.30度附近，即當地首都維拉港之東北約620公里，震源深度約600公里。（USGS/天文台）</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T05:50:39.601508+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":144,"images":0,"source":"明報 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T02:55:02+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T07:45:47.987256+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T05:44:16.796370+00:00","content_hash":"ab8cb1c0bd7dfb87bf693ef51ae34b4eaa4f11e62825d6844163ac3678ca55b1","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}